# Firmware libraries

PlatformIO builds local libraries from this directory. Current control code uses
PIDF/ for the speed and steering controllers. Other directories include hardware
helpers and older bring-up code; do not assume every library here is active.

Encoder/ is a bundled third-party quadrature encoder library; retain its upstream
attribution and examples. The active wrapper in esp32_Encoder/ uses ESP32Encoder
from the dependency list in ../platformio.ini; ../src/app/App.h owns that wrapper.
The current IMU and steering sensor wrappers live in ../src/hw/.

Project code: ../src/; configuration: ../config/; source map: ../../CLAUDE.md
Private network defaults: ../config/network_secrets.h (gitignored).

From the repository root, with Docker running:

    docker\mor_luam.bat fw-test
    docker\mor_luam.bat fw-build

Host tests compile PIDF against Arduino stubs and compare it with the saved old
implementation in ../test_host/old_pidf/. Builds regenerate the packed web page;
edit ../web/ rather than ../src/web/WebPage.h.
